        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.21.1+2KI.21.2+2KI.21.3+2KI.21.4+2KI.21.5+2KI.21.6+2KI.21.7+2KI.21.8+2KI.21.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 21:1-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Manaase akaba aine emyaka ikumi n'ebiri, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera emyaka makumi ataano n'etaano Yerusaalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.28.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 28:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, naakuratira emitwarize erikunugwa ey'amahanga agu MUKAMA yaabingire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.30.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 30:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.31.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "31:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.18.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 18:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.17.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 17:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ahabw'okuba akagaruka yaayombeka ebyombeko by'emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu ebi Hezekia ishe yaasheenyire, yaayombekyera Baali amatambiro, yaakora Ashera, yaaguma naaramya eihe ry'omu iguru ryona, naariheereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.6.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 6:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi yaakora n'amatambiro omu nju ya MUKAMA, ei MUKAMA yaagambireho ati: Omuri Yerusaalemu nimwo eiziina ryangye ririguma ebiro byona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaayombekyera eihe ry'omu iguru ryona amatambiro omu bikaari byombi eby'enju ya MUKAMA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.28.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 28:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 28:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.18.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 18:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaarabya abatabani omu muriro omu ruhanga rwa mwene Hinoomu; yaaguma naaraguza abafumu ebiribaho, naarogyesa, naakoresa abateezi b'ebyatsi, naayehanuuza aha barikugambisa emizimu n'aha barogi. Yaakora ebibi bingi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaamugwisa kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaata ekishushani ekirikuramibwa eki yaakozire omu nju ya Ruhanga, ei Ruhanga yaagambiire Daudi n'omutabani Sulemaani, naagira ati: omuri egi nju n'omuri Yerusaalemu, ei naatooraine omu nganda za Israeli zoona, nimweo ndita eiziina ryangye kugumamu ebiro byona; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi Abaisraeli ku barita omutima aha kworobera ebi naabaragiire byona, n'ebiragiro ebyatairweho, n'emigyenzo yoona, ebyaragiirwe nibiraba omuri Musa, tindigaruka kwiha bigyere byabo omu nsi ei naateereireho baishenkurubo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atyo Manaase yaahabya Abayuda n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, kyabareetera kukora ebibi ebirikukira eby'amahanga agu MUKAMA yaacwekyerereize omu maisho g'Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi MUKAMA yaagamba na Manaase n'abantu be, kwonka tibakyetaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 36:6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.20.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bag 20:17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 28:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nikyo MUKAMA yaabateereize abakuru by'eihe ry'omugabe wa Asiria, bakakwata Manaase, bakamubohesa enjegyere n'emihama y'emiringa, bakamutwra Babulooni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.32.26"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 32:26",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ku yaabaire ari omu busaasi, yaashaba MUKAMA Ruhanga we kumugirira embabazi, yaayecureeza munonga omu maisho ga Ruhanga wa baishenkuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DAN.4.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Dan 4:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Atyo yaashaba Ruhanga, nawe yaikiriza okweshengyereza kwe, kandi yaahurira okushaba kwe, yaamugarura Yerusaalemu omu bugabe bwe. Manaase yaamanyira aho MUKAMA ku niwe Ruhanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima y'ebyo yaayombeka orugo rw'amabaare enyima y'orurembo rwa Daudi aha rubaju rwa Gihoni orw'oburengyerwa-izooba omu ruhanga, yaaruhitsya aha irembo ry'eby'enyanja, yaaruziguza Ofeli, yaarutunguura, rwahika ahaiguru munonga; kandi yaata abakuru b'amahe omu ndembo za Yuda zoona ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaihaho baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga, n'ekishushani kiri ekirikuramibwa yaakiiha omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'amatambiro goona agu yaabaire ayombekire aha kabungo k'enju ya MUKAMA n'omuri Yerusaalemu, yaabinaga aheeru y'orurembo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi yaahunduuza eitambiro rya MUKAMA, yaaritambiraho ebitambo by'empongano z'okusiima ahabw'obusingye n'eby'okuhimbisa; kandi yaaragiira Abayuda boona kuheereza MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'obu kiraabe kyabaire kityo, abantu baaguma nibatambira ebitambo omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, kwonka nibabitambira MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo wenka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Endiijo mirimo ya Manaase, n'okushaba oku yaashabire Ruhanga we, n'ebigambo ebi abahanuuzi baabaire bamugambira omu iziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, reeba bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyakozirwe abagabe ba Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 33:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi n'okushaba kwe n'oku Ruhanga yaikiriize kuhurira okweshengyereza kwe, n'ekibi kye kyona, n'okucumura kwe, n'ahu yaayombekire ebyombeko omu myany amikuru y'okuramizamu, akatamu Ashera n'ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, obu yaabaire atakeeteisize, ebyo byona bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebyagambirwe abahanuuzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.33.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
