              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi Manaase ishe yaakozire. Yaatambira ebishushani byona ebi Manaase ishe yaakozire, yaabiheereza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.33.22",
